sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant NextJS as Next.js Server
    participant DB as Database
    participant GoProxy as Go Proxy
    participant VSCode as VS Code App<br/>(Databricks)

    User->>Browser: Navigate to /code-editor
    Browser->>NextJS: Request page

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over NextJS,DB: SSO-SPN Token Acquisition
        NextJS->>DB: Lookup user's SPN mapping
        DB-->>NextJS: SPN credentials (clientId, secret)
        NextJS->>VSCode: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>(client_credentials)
        VSCode-->>NextJS: Workspace access token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over NextJS: Token Encryption
        NextJS->>NextJS: Encrypt token with AES-256-GCM
        NextJS->>NextJS: Generate proxy URL
    end

    NextJS-->>Browser: Render page with iframe src
    Browser->>GoProxy: Request code editor (encrypted token in URL)

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over GoProxy: Token Handling
        GoProxy->>GoProxy: Decrypt token from URL
        GoProxy->>VSCode: Forward request with Bearer token
    end

    VSCode-->>GoProxy: VS Code interface
    GoProxy-->>Browser: Proxied response
    Browser->>User: Display VS Code editor

    Note over Browser,VSCode: WebSocket connections for<br/>terminal, LSP, and debugging
